{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011Cf5nfattQiymK2vkMkEd6","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! All tests pass. Let me verify the complete test output:\n\n**Command:** `./mvnw test` from `sample-service/`\n\n**Result:** BUILD SUCCESS\n- OrderControllerTest: 9 tests (4 original + 5 new for cancel functionality)\n- ShipmentControllerTest: 6 tests (5 original + 1 new for cancelled order rejection)\n- CustomerControllerTest: 3 tests passed\n- SampleServiceApplicationTests: 1 test passed\n- **Total: 19 tests, 0 failures, 0 errors**\n\n---\n\n```\n<<PHASE:REVIEW>>\n```\n\n**Acceptance Criteria Mapping:**\n\n1. ✅ **Existing build passes** - `./mvnw test` returned BUILD SUCCESS\n2. ✅ **Existing tests pass** - All original OrderControllerTest (4), ShipmentControllerTest (5), and CustomerControllerTest (3) tests pass\n3. ✅ **POST /orders/{orderId}/cancel** - Implemented in OrderController.kt:49-77, tests in OrderControllerTest (5 new tests)\n   - ✅ Cancels active order, persists it, cancels CREATED shipments (test: `cancels created shipments when cancelling order`)\n   - ✅ Returns CANCELLED status (test: `cancels an active order and returns 200 with cancelled order`)\n4. ✅ **Error responses consistent** - Uses ConflictException (409) and ResourceNotFoundException (404) like existing endpoints\n5. ✅ **Idempotency and edge cases:**\n   - ✅ Repeated cancel succeeds (test: `cancelling an already cancelled order succeeds and changes nothing`)\n   - ✅ Cancel blocked by CONFIRMED shipment changes nothing (test: `returns 409 when cancelling order with confirmed shipment and changes nothing`)\n   - ✅ Unknown order returns 404 (test: `returns 404 with error envelope when cancelling non-existent order`)\n   - ✅ Shipment for cancelled order returns 409 (test in ShipmentControllerTest: `rejects creating shipment for cancelled order with 409 and error envelope`)\n6. ✅ **No new Maven dependency** - pom.xml unchanged\n7. ✅ **No unrelated production file changes** - Only modified necessary files\n\n**Diff Review:**\n\n| File | Changes | Necessity |\n|------|---------|-----------|\n| Order.kt | Added OrderStatus enum and status field with default ACTIVE | Required - orders need status tracking |\n| ApiError.kt | Added ORDER_CANNOT_BE_CANCELLED and ORDER_CANCELLED error codes | Required - new error scenarios |\n| OrderController.kt | Added cancel endpoint, injected ShipmentRepository | Required - implements cancel feature |\n| ShipmentController.kt | Added order cancellation check in create, injected OrderRepository | Required - prevent shipment on cancelled order |\n| OrderControllerTest.kt | Added 5 new tests for cancel functionality | Required - test coverage for new feature |\n| ShipmentControllerTest.kt | Added 1 test for rejected shipment on cancelled order | Required - test coverage for constraint |\n\n**Unresolved Findings:** None\n\nAll requirements are implemented and tested.\n\n---\n\n```\n<<PHASE:DONE>>\n```\n\nRequirement: Add an endpoint to cancel orders with status tracking, allowing cancellation only if no shipments are confirmed, with idempotent behavior for already-cancelled orders.\n\nChanged:\n- Order.kt: Added OrderStatus enum (ACTIVE, CANCELLED) and status field to Order data class\n- ApiError.kt: Added ORDER_CANNOT_BE_CANCELLED and ORDER_CANCELLED to ErrorCode enum\n- OrderController.kt: Added POST /orders/{orderId}/cancel endpoint with all-or-nothing semantics for confirmed shipments and idempotent behavior\n- ShipmentController.kt: Added validation to reject shipment creation for cancelled orders\n- OrderControllerTest.kt: Added 5 new tests covering cancel success, idempotency, error cases, and shipment cancellation\n- ShipmentControllerTest.kt: Added 1 new test for shipment rejection on cancelled orders\n\nTests:\n- OrderControllerTest.`cancels an active order and returns 200 with cancelled order` - covers basic cancel operation\n- OrderControllerTest.`cancelling an already cancelled order succeeds and changes nothing` - covers idempotency\n- OrderControllerTest.`returns 404 with error envelope when cancelling non-existent order` - covers missing order error\n- OrderControllerTest.`returns 409 when cancelling order with confirmed shipment and changes nothing` - covers rejection with CONFIRMED shipment\n- OrderControllerTest.`cancels created shipments when cancelling order` - covers cascading cancellation of CREATED shipments\n- ShipmentControllerTest.`rejects creating shipment for cancelled order with 409 and error envelope` - covers shipment rejection on cancelled order\n\nVerification: `./mvnw test` from `sample-service/` returned BUILD SUCCESS with 19 tests passing (0 failures)\n\nNot done: Nothing - all acceptance criteria met and verified."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3326,"cache_read_input_tokens":33719,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3326},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d36d448d-0937-432d-88bb-2006c27974a2","uuid":"5d949fdc-1d0f-4e17-8b6c-9a2ce6d342e7","timestamp":"2026-09-15T19:36:52.754Z","request_id":"req_011Cf5nfaXJyQF6MowcgpBrc"}
